  "notes": "Draft. Invented details for the people kind of Mind Map and for the Three Strikes round. No real person, no address, no real phone number format. Birthdays are month and day only. Extensions are four-digit numbers with no repeated neighbours, no runs of three and no leading zero. Town names are made up for this game; they sound like English villages. On Nov 2, 2026 all 39 were looked up as English Wikipedia titles. Three were real places (Heronsgate, Nettlecombe, Tarnaby) and were renamed (Heronsfold, Nettlebrook, Tarnwick). A title search cannot rule out very small hamlets, so a quick map search is still wise before release. First names come from NAMES and NAMES_MORE, surnames from surnames.json. Detail fields for one guest: birthday, town, pet (kind and name), hobby, car, food, extension.",
